Igno&#x017F;cas petimus, Vacerra; tanti<lb/>
Non e&#x017F;t, vt placeam tibi, perire.</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Martial. libr. VIII. epigr.</hi> 69.</hi></note>.</p></div><lb/>
<div><opener><salute><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#fr">Mein Herr,</hi></hi></salute></opener><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#in">W</hi>eil Sie keine Raupen &#x017F;ammlen, &#x017F;ollen &#x017F;olches<lb/>
