Quid &#x017F;olidum crepet, et pictae tectoria linguae.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#i">Per&#x017F;.</hi></hi></hi></note>;</p><lb/>
<p>Er muß, was &#x017F;einem Amte wohlan&#x017F;ta&#x0364;ndig i&#x017F;t,<lb/>
